+<article class="example-panel" id="example-replay" data-example="replay" data-category="AI runtime"><p class="eyebrow">AI runtime · Executed offline · Kujo 1.9.0</p><h3>AI calls and replay</h3><p>Replay a recorded model response offline.</p><p class="example-note">Run from the pinned Kujo repository root: the cassette fixture directory is required.</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code><span class="syntax-token">func</span> kv(label, value) {
